# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Tuuina-atu tusi: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: ([''] tccompare: ['']), laina-fou.
